{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X的人物心理因果和前后转折交代不如Y完整，部分感受条目也略显堆叠，需要观众自行补足联系。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的短句、重点加亮和大小层级，更适合边听边扫，观众能迅速抓住人物当下的核心心事；而且大量感受与具体音乐变化同步出现，像声音的起伏、停顿、回落和重新涌起，都有较细的对应，情绪质地更丰富。Y的优势是把人物为什么这样想、前后为什么发生变化解释得更完整，尤其是从害怕显露喜欢、到害怕失去亲近、再到接受无法保证未来的心理演变，叙事连续性更强。综合而言，X更能兼顾即时观看和音乐感受，Y则胜在心理解释与整体故事的易理解程度。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "70bf1272-c296-4baf-a518-4b30beca2ead", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T180857623342Z", "elapsed_seconds": 115.641, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T18:10:53.283518+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f6ded1d46074cfc3b92d1522e69c4bdd9ff8e94196cddd00180d14cf3f096e02", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "too